    <field name="scopecontent_teim">Series I consists of files kept by Paul Langland on various performances, artists and subjects. It includes  correspondence, artist&#39;s files, programs and promotional material, press, interviews, and production information. Additionally, it includes choreography notes both for Langland&#39;s personal performances and original choreography, as well as performances associated with his position in NYU&#39;s Experimental Theater Wing. Much of the material is related to Paul Langland&#39;s involvement in the developement, teaching and performance of the &#34;Allan Wayne Work&#34; and Contact Improvisation dance techniques. This largely includes class notes and information on workshops and conferences, as well as information on various fellowships and residencies held by Paul Langland.</field>
